      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This problem is known for months. I saw many months ago the camera problems and need some re-design controls because it's not good. I discovered also why it's so bad.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tGgzoOQxVvs&t=1s made video for it what happened and how to deal with it.\n\nThe only answer i have (from other threads here long time posted ago) they will look someday at it, but it's not planned as important problem. But they are aware of camera control problems, but it's not placed above in the queue list. \n\nThe lens is indeed bit annoying but it showed where camera exactly is. Though it should have more transparency... its indeed bit harder to look at screen. Lucky you can change mode to seperate the lens.\n\nI think it will take many months before they finally re-design the camera.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
