      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seing this marked as complete while only a lock button was added and the buttons are still almost impossible to select makes us sad. We had these cannys since almost two years marked as \"under review\" and adding a lock button didn't solve the issue this canny is about (read the title of the canny please, it's not about a lock button).\nI re-opened it here now:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/camera-buttons-are-still-too-hard-to-hit",
